---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie Policy | KK Coaching"
  description="Information about cookies, Google Analytics and consent controls on kkcoaching.fit."
  lang="en"
  path="/cookies"
  altPath="/pl/cookies"
>
  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: 12 August 2026.</p>

      <h2>1. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small files stored on your device by a website. A site can also use similar browser storage, such as localStorage, to remember settings and choices.</p>

      <h2>2. What kkcoaching.fit uses</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Name / technology</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Type</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>kk_cookie_consent (localStorage)</td><td>Remembers whether you accepted or rejected analytics.</td><td>Necessary site setting</td></tr>
          <tr><td>_ga, _ga_*</td><td>Google Analytics 4 — helps understand how visitors use the website.</td><td>Analytics — optional</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>3. When Google Analytics loads</h2>
      <p>Google Analytics is only loaded after you accept analytics in the cookie banner. Rejecting optional analytics does not prevent you from using the website, enquiry form or other core functions.</p>

      <h2>4. Changing or withdrawing your choice</h2>
      <p>You can reopen the consent controls at any time using the button below or “Cookie settings” in the website footer. If you reject analytics after previously accepting it, analytics is disabled and the site removes the Google Analytics cookies it can access.</p>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-dark" data-cookie-settings>Open cookie settings</button>

      <h2>5. Browser controls</h2>
      <p>You can also remove or block cookies using your browser settings. Clearing site data may also remove your saved analytics choice.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page { padding: 72px 0; }
  .legal-page .container { max-width: 780px; }
  .legal-page h1 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.2vw, 2.4rem); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .legal-page h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .legal-page p { color: var(--steel); margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .updated { font-size: 0.88rem; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 12px; }
  th, td { text-align: left; padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E3E5E8; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--steel); vertical-align: top; }
  th { color: var(--graphite); }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    table { display: block; overflow-x: auto; }
    [data-cookie-settings] { width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
